---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'
import BaseLayout from '~/components/BaseLayout.astro'
import Footer from '~/components/Footer.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Muhamad Zainal Arifin"
  description="Privacy policy of muhamadzain.me"
  lang="en"
>
  <BaseLayout>
    <a
      href="/"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-warm-500 dark:text-warm-400 hover:text-warm-700 dark:hover:text-warm-300 transition-colors mb-8 group"
    >
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        viewBox="0 0 20 20"
        fill="currentColor"
        class="w-4 h-4 group-hover:-translate-x-1 transition-transform"
      >
        <path
          fill-rule="evenodd"
          d="M17 10a.75.75 0 01-.75.75H5.612l4.158 3.96a.75.75 0 11-1.04 1.08l-5.5-5.25a.75.75 0 010-1.08l5.5-5.25a.75.75 0 111.04 1.08L5.612 9.25H16.25A.75.75 0 0117 10z"
          clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
      </svg>
      Back to home
    </a>

    <article
      class="animate-fade-in-up opacity-0 prose prose-warm dark:prose-invert max-w-none prose-headings:font-display prose-h1:text-3xl sm:prose-h1:text-4xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:text-xl prose-p:leading-relaxed"
    >
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-warm-600 dark:text-warm-400">
        This policy explains which personal data is processed when you visit
        <code>muhamadzain.me</code>, on what legal basis, and which rights you
        have as a data subject.
      </p>

      <h2>Controller</h2>
      <p>
        Muhamad Zainal Arifin<br />
        Surakarta, Central Java<br />
        Indonesia<br />
        Email: <a href="mailto:muhamadzaindev@gmail.com"
          >muhamadzaindev@gmail.com</a
        >
      </p>

      <h2>Hosting</h2>
      <p>
        The website is served by a hosting provider. When the site is accessed,
        technically necessary access data is processed, in particular IP
        address, date and time, requested URL, referrer, browser and device
        information, and technical status information. This processing is
        required in order to deliver the website and to ensure security and
        stability.
      </p>

      <h2>Local browser storage</h2>
      <p>
        The website stores the following values locally in your browser for
        convenience functions (no cookie, no transmission to the operator):
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li><code>visited</code> – session storage; suppresses entrance animations on repeated visits within a session.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can delete these entries at any time via your browser settings.</p>

      <h2>Email contact</h2>
      <p>
        You can contact me directly at <a
          href="mailto:muhamadzaindev@gmail.com"
          >muhamadzaindev@gmail.com</a
        >. Information you provide in such correspondence is processed solely to
        handle your inquiry and is kept for as long as necessary to respond to
        and document the request, unless statutory retention obligations apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Embedded fonts and logos</h2>
      <p>
        Fonts are served locally from the same server that delivers the website;
        no connection to external font providers (e.g. Google Fonts) is
        established.
      </p>

      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        This website contains links to external services (e.g. GitHub,
        LinkedIn). Data is only transmitted to the respective provider once you
        actively click on a link. The privacy policies of the respective
        provider then apply.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on the applicable data protection law you have, in particular,
        the rights to information, rectification, erasure, restriction of
        processing, data portability and objection. Where processing is based on
        consent, you may withdraw it at any time with effect for the future. An
        informal email to <a href="mailto:muhamadzaindev@gmail.com"
          >muhamadzaindev@gmail.com</a
        > is sufficient.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this privacy policy</h2>
      <p>
        This privacy policy may be adjusted when technology, services used or
        legal requirements change. The version published on this page applies.
      </p>
    </article>

    <Footer />
  </BaseLayout>
</Layout>
